{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the endless world of Steinstern and get lost in the increasingly large mazes. Fight the enemies, upgrade your weapons and your ship to stand a chance against the hordes of enemies that keep getting stronger as well. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play alone or in local coop in any of the five difficulties (from &quot;Very Easy&quot; to &quot;Very Hard&quot;). </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find a way through the square and hexagonal mazes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538030/extras/mazes-2025.png?t=1745190686\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open the locked doors ...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538030/extras/steam-gifs-door.gif?t=1745190686\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">... by getting the right combinations or by throwing the balls in the baskets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538030/extras/steam-gifs-balllock.gif?t=1745190686\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538030/extras/steam-gifs-lock.gif?t=1745190686\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade  ship and weapons in the workshops.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538030/extras/Workshop.png?t=1745190686\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Flight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1538030/155646442c806d737593c91147ea7e1d360cb68d.jpg"},{"name":"Get-together","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.c